<a id="H1" name="H1"></a>
<section class="stt_h1">
<div class="container">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<h1 class="align-text-top allow-hyphens" >Lothstraße Campus</h1>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6">
<p
class="font-light align-text-top paragraph-with-links"
>With 12,502 students, the campus Lothstraße located north-west of the main railway station, is the largest site of Hochschule München. All central administrative departments, nine departments, the Library, as well as the CAREER Centre, the E-Learning Center and the Centre for Continuing Education are based here.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
